{"id":"n66278-2-7","stage":1,"title":"신호 · 铃声","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66278-2-7-1","ko":"이상하네. 신호는 가는데 민준이가 전화를 안 받아.","zh":"真奇怪。信号是通的，但敏俊不接电话啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이상하네.","meaning":"奇怪，古怪","explanation":"이상하다：奇怪，古怪；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"이상하다","audio":"/audio/8ccfeb4ba665917849ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71167","senseId":"2","lemma":"이상하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이상하네","audio":"/audio/11a66ae9641a879073e0.mp3"}},{"text":"신호는","meaning":"铃声","explanation":"신호：铃声；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"신호","audio":"/audio/617aa217dbc92e8aaffc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66278","senseId":"2","lemma":"신호","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"신호는","audio":"/audio/975698f6b0aed7c24ce8.mp3"}},{"text":"가는데","meaning":"持续","explanation":"가다：持续；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"33","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가는데","audio":"/audio/769c4e4621c06eaf653d.mp3"}},{"text":"민준이가","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"민준이가","audio":"/audio/2d578794e58a65e57305.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준이가","audio":"/audio/2d578794e58a65e57305.mp3"}},{"text":"전화를","meaning":"电话","explanation":"전화：电话；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"전화","audio":"/audio/6db518d738ede9912d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20260","senseId":"2","lemma":"전화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전화를","audio":"/audio/e1c6eb44c1e1611ee60a.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/